Subject: Estimating moth densities from goal post counts
Message-ID: <IWlkzoB25fQ.lQ_zALGhEhYJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/IWlkzoB25fQ/m/lQ_zALGhEhYJ>
